Qpc5mHHDvsYQ7kNvwFf-Q6X&_nc_oc=AdouH3I_L4rsaevmHr6UXx_-HVmYgyaFKUwJi3E_fvLYdfF_aENKHbW7Yj_WMDHlsrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBoUKJKqHxq2LvRNpjJAUr_hqKa29Zv_zEWREuFLBgkPw&oe=6A661637"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=msutO6fJPEoQ7kNvwFl9sxm&_nc_oc=AdoCRBmzNstHd2zcd1aSsg0lsYmq--uW3EVxsEWI0w9mb_AIkG5IzvPUNXu4AGUsi9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDAQm5qN0QtasuYxP5YB_jNuzLM78XAomTosHF5jDEcrA&oe=6A6617CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_UYE6rkoPL0Q7kNvwH8jNml&_nc_oc=AdoVxYu0v448TO9zTnCxVR5RMe0FfMi-C2uxxLSfoKLuMen2hC9FinypDHV_IKluU5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAqc9mfnesnO3kmoXQa_mDtmgQJ5KD7pcpyheu-hi8aeQ&oe=6A6604EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YCHhd6d1x8AQ7kNvwHLxvnl&_nc_oc=Adqq5e7QHaGYLrGpAczw-PMAPz-OhdT5fXYu7IgCg-V0tO001aGXKq71NQxwpnVfU4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBmlm235_YNVA7cKCA6u4YtAvg8f1Tvq21RI7-L6NVFg&oe=6A662683"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A1W6c0U0SrUQ7kNvwH9F4j4&_nc_oc=AdpY7byydiK7GMBX2n7wc-tuG_pr_YUfubwIoJGLSKmRinIM0PAfYHJw8_sbUP2f2YE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCqBOOWjMbm7CQn5lxmgwaU9uT62bpZ0V_zpnMDE9cn8g&oe=6A661ED8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=un2j_ISN5FgQ7kNvwEd2oPz&_nc_oc=AdozvvuT-9wBFXsggwU6fyN3U0NyuAmvlE8hbTtZKMzvXlxTRx-cpgCWDbYagUUeZSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBonSXcVkDpF_dBcSu2l9g6pkve14dM8wKA0ua_BaqhTw&oe=6A65F9BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080